Licensing for the OSM US Pedestrian Working Group (PWG) repository

This repository contains material under three licenses. The full license
texts are in the LICENSES/ directory. Per-file licensing information is in
REUSE.toml and in the license notices at the top of individual files, which
take precedence over this summary.

Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 2.0 (LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-2.0.txt)
  - The PWG Schema and PWG Guide, including every MediaWiki (.mw) file and the
    schema JSON files: schema/, guide/, templates/
  - Files generated from the schema: presets/pwg_schema.xml,
    styles/pwg_schema.mapcss, visualizations/pwg_schema_*.ultra
  - Documentation: README.md, CHANGELOG.md, resources/icons/tiers/README.md.
    Code examples in the documentation are also available under CC0 1.0.

Creative Commons Zero 1.0 Universal (LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt)
  - The JOSM validator rules: validators/
  - The hand-written Ultra tag maps: visualizations/*.yaml
  - The tier icons: resources/icons/tiers/*.svg and *.png

MIT License (LICENSES/MIT.txt)
  - Scripts, tests, and examples: scripts/, tests/, examples/
  - Repository configuration: .github/, .editorconfig, .gitignore,
    .prettierrc.js
  Files produced by the scripts are not covered by the MIT License. They are
  adaptations of the schema they are generated from and carry its license.

Copyright OpenStreetMap US Pedestrian Working Group contributors. The PWG
Schema and PWG Guide are also published on the OpenStreetMap Wiki, where the
page histories record additional contributors:
https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Foundation/Local_Chapters/United_States/Pedestrian_Working_Group
